      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fa30b66b36d4b12af626dc8|full_name}: Not the world creator - but a few of us were trying to troubleshoot this over in the Discord, and some great questions were asked that made me wonder what the actual relationship is between Unity batches and draw calls (because they usually get used synonymously there) but I couldn't find much info - and now I know! 🌞 \n\nI think we eventually did figure out that the perf issues might have been caused by that shader having an unnamed GrabPass because Silent figured people would only use it for an ocean / one body of water. \n\nSuper interesting/helpful info! Thank you for writing this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
