  "details": "while working on my newest map port i encountered an enormous framerate discrepancy between editor (play mode) and VRChat (in some cases a diference of ~90fps) so it was recomended to me that i should boot up intelGPA to see what was going on, i found out that in some places i was getting well over 3000 drawcalls whereas in unity i would barely ever go above 1600 (worst case places). world id : wrld_86fc9cb9-b9c4-4f83-b6c1-f7a79a2abd33",
